Happy to make a PR if this is ok to change 


Edit: this condition https://github.com/spf13/cobra/blob/de187e874d1ca382320088f8f6d76333408e5c2e/doc/rest_docs.go#L146 will prevent help from being documented but I still there's value on exporting `initCompleteCmd` to make this more focused to what's needed

